.TH SETTIMEOFDAY 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
settimeofday \- sets wall clock time or the obsolete kernel timezone; typically requires cap_sys_time
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/time.h>
.B int settimeofday(const struct timeval* value, const struct timezone* zone);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets wall clock time or the obsolete kernel timezone; typically requires CAP_SYS_TIME.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR settimeofday (2)
